I fear the worst","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm7","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"But how could you leave us all behind?","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm7","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"There's so much to say, but there's so little time","columns":50,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":28,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":47,"beat":5}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"So how do I say goodbye","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"To someone's who's been with me for my whole damn life?","columns":61,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G#","column":40,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#","column":52,"beat":6},{"symbol":"A#","column":59,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"You gave me my name and the colour of your eyes","columns":47,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":28,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D#","column":44,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I see your face when I look at mine","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"So how do I, how do I, how do I say goodbye?","columns":44,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":24,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":42,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"When I couldn't","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm7","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"You always saw the best in me","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm7","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Right or wrong, you were always on my side","columns":54,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":21,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":40,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A#11","column":46,"beat":6},{"symbol":"A#","column":52,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"But I'm scared","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm7","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Of what life without you's like","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm7","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"And I saw the way she looked into your eyes","columns":43,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":22,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":40,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And I promised, if you go","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I will make sure she's alright","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"So how do I say goodbye","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"To someone's who's been with me for my whole damn life?","columns":61,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":25,"beat":1},{"symbol":"G#","column":40,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":52,"beat":3},{"symbol":"A#","column":59,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-28